add('Quantum sensing for water-quality changes','Continuous-variable simulation | NYUAD Hackathon | 6 October 2026',[f'{gain:.2f}× lower total error in a controlled 16-node pilot',f'{optgain:.2f}× lower optical error at equal launched probe power','A dissolved-salt proxy calibrated from published optical data','Simulated feasibility; no claim of a deployed chemical detector'],note='Main results: results/summary.json. Sources and assumptions: docs/SOURCES.md. All concentration errors concern differential NaCl in mg/kg. Pilot assumes 100 m links, 10 nW/node, 1 s windows and 0.05 mK shared temperature residual.')
