add('Continuous averaging encounters slow drift','Exact variance of a rectangular average of a 60-second correlated temperature process',chart=chart('log₁₀ integration time (s)','Total RMSE (mg/kg)',ss),body=['Short windows are optical-noise limited; longer windows encounter correlated drift.','Fixed calibration offsets average across nodes, not across time. Long windows also blur fast events.'],note='docs/MODEL.md OU integrated-covariance formula. Stationary mean estimation, not transient tracking. Independent 0.03mg/kg node calibration offsets assumed.',figure='04_averaging_temperature')
